orgar Mines</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32084,31114,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32084, 31114, 5)</a>). There are two <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a>, three <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spiders</a> and four <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\">Frost Dragon Hatchlings</a>, and there is not much in the way of running area.<br/>\nOne of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir%20Quara%20Scout%20Caves\">Hrodmir Quara Scout Caves</a> can be found nearby.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\"><img alt=\"Frost Dragon Hatchling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frost_Dragon_Hatchling_219cfa.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\">Frost Dragon Hatchling</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">745</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-55× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Frosty Heart (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Spellbook of Enlightenment (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"n